/**
\page page_sttriggerdata2012 StTriggerData2012

\brief Concrete StTriggerData implementation for STAR Run 12 (year 2012) trigger data.

\section sec2012_overview Overview

StTriggerData2012 is the concrete implementation of the StTriggerData abstract interface for
<b>STAR Run 12 (year 2012)</b> raw trigger data.  It wraps a \c TriggerDataBlk2012 structure
(from \c StDaqLib/TRG/trgStructures2012.h) and exposes its content through the common
StTriggerData accessor API.

Compared to StTriggerData2009, Run 12 adds TPC mask DSM readout, the MTD–VPD TAC difference,
BBC large-tile TDC, and the consolidated l2sum() accessor.

\section sec2012_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
StObject
  └── StTriggerData          (abstract interface)
        └── StTriggerData2012
\endcode

\section sec2012_runyear Run Year
Run 12, calendar year 2012 &mdash; p+p collisions at &radic;s = 200 GeV.

\section sec2012_datamembers Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| mData  | TriggerDataBlk2012* | Pointer to the raw Run 12 trigger data block. |
| EvtDesc | EvtDescData2012* | Decoded event descriptor (transient). |
| L1_DSM  | L1_DSM_Data2012* | Decoded L1 DSM data (transient). |
| TrgSum  | TrgSumData2012* | Decoded trigger summary (transient). |
| mBC1[11]…mQT4[11] | various block pointers | Per-crossing crate sub-blocks (transient). |

\section sec2012_new New Compared to 2009

- tpcMaskDSM(int channel) &mdash; TPC mask DSM word.
- mtdVpdTacDiff() &mdash; MTD–VPD TAC difference.
- bbcEarliestTDCLarge(StBeamDirection, int prepost=0) &mdash; BBC large-tile earliest TDC.
- bbcTimeDifferenceLarge() &mdash; BBC large-tile time difference.
- l2sum() &mdash; 64-bit L2 summary.

\section sec2012_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StEvent* event = static_cast<StEvent*>(GetInputDS("StEvent"));
const StTriggerData* trgData = event->triggerData();
if (trgData) {
    unsigned short tpcMask = trgData->tpcMaskDSM(0);
    unsigned short mtdVpd  = trgData->mtdVpdTacDiff();
    unsigned long long l2s = trgData->l2sum();
}
\endcode

\see StTriggerData
\see StTriggerData2009
\see StTriggerData2013
*/
